{"path":"experimental/randint","title":"std::experimental::randint","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>randint","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/randint","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Generates a random integer in the closed interval [a, b].","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/random&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> IntType <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>IntType randint<span class=\"br0\">(</span> IntType a, IntType b <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Generates a random integer in the closed interval <code>[a, b]</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> a, b\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integer values specifying the range\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A random integer <span class=\"texhtml\">i</span> in the closed interval <code>[a, b]</code>, produced using a thread-local instance of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/uniform_int_distribution\"><span class=\"kw1513\">std::<span class=\"me2\">uniform_int_distribution</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>IntType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> invoked with the <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions_2#per-thread_engine\">per-thread random number engine</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Remarks\">Remarks</h3>\n<p>If <code>IntType</code> is not one of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">short</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">short</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code>, or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code>, the program is ill-formed.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">a <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/random&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> random_number <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">randint</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">100</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">999</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"random 3-digit number: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> random_number <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>random 3-digit number: 273</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/reseed\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reseed</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   reseeds the per-thread random engine  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Remarks","id":"Remarks"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::randint","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Generates a random integer in the closed interval [a, b]."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"a, b"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A random integer i in the closed interval [a, b], produced using a thread-local instance of std::uniform_int_distribution<IntType> invoked with the per-thread…"},{"label":"Remarks","note":"If IntType is not one of short, int, long, long long, unsigned short, unsigned int, unsigned long, or unsigned long long, the program is ill-formed."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"reseed","note":"reseeds the per-thread random engine"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":136,"codeBlockCount":2}
